cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MINFLUXR in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "MINFLUXR"
abstract: >-
  An interactive R/Shiny application for visualization and analysis of Abberior
  MINFLUX data: localization quality control, de-blinking, clustering, spatial and
  two-colour point-pattern statistics for imaging data; time-signature analysis,
  cycle-based MSD, CVE, jump-distance, confinement and state analyses for
  single-particle tracking; and a simulator for ground-truth validation.
authors:
